end

fn da_shr ins edit ulong 8192 meta edit ulong 512 d ulong aop ulong imm ulong to void
r = new ulong 8 0
da_r0 edit r 17
put r 1 d
put r 2 and aop 0xffff
put r 6 imm
put r 7 shl shr aop 16 24
da_emit edit ins edit meta view r 0
end

